SHIP dogfood-proof b416c6eb895d62f4032b088f1fe2a68f033d7245
read: blind Opus (Blind-Warden-Proof) over e44da0167...b416c6eb8 on the security-class paths (.github/workflows/e2e-shards.yml, package.json) plus tools/dogfood-proof.sh, genesis/unbaked.json and the place-meme.ts stage-row gate: LAND, no P1/P2 (workflow: triggers, runner and permissions unchanged; one fixed LARES_PYTHON path into GITHUB_ENV from the runner's own HOME; HOME scoped to its step; package.json one script, no lifecycle hook). CI 42450020328 green on rerun. L9 unit reds 16 -> 29/29; dogfood-memory-restand e2e green alone.
owed (P3): tools/dogfood-proof.sh unset LAR_BAGS LAR_GENESIS beside its exports (an operator shell exporting LAR_BAGS=&lt;checkout>/bags would write back into the tracked tree); corepack pnpm under a fresh HOME may fetch; stage-row gate compares raw strings (Memory/, %2F, no trailing slash skip the missing-key check while stage readers filter on the exact prefix); a keyed row's /path children can sit at another key's derived title; noop/conflict verdicts and writes bypassing placeMeme skip the gate (the read-side law covers them).

